# Build context = repository root (docker build -f deploy/docker/Dockerfile .).
# BuildKit (the default builder since Docker 23) reads this file because it
# sits next to the Dockerfile and is named after it; a .dockerignore in the
# repo root is not needed. Allow-list: everything out, then only what the
# relay image compiles.
*
!packages/klunki_engine/
!packages/klunki_net/
!deploy/docker/relay/
**/.dart_tool/
**/build/
**/.packages
packages/*/test/
